  "description": "AsiBackbone 5.1.0 is a backward-compatible stabilization release for the stable 5.x line. It adds automated public API compatibility baselines, documented repository security and branch-retention controls, security-advisory distribution tooling, and public support and maintainer policies. Package IDs, public namespaces, runtime behavior, the net10.0 target, and AssemblyVersion 5.0.0.0 remain unchanged.",
